# sys-fog-defog: Route 210 North has FOG. Defog from the party menu
# (FIELD_MOVES 14: do_defog_func + 0C4) sets FLAG_DEFOG_ACTIVE and the weather to CLEAR; a save/load
# keeps both. The `fog`/`defog` screenshot lines mark the browser spec's contrast check.
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_RELIC
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_BIBAREL 50 platinum:MOVE_DEFOG
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_210_NORTH 498 522 down
until idle
+0 assert state weather "platinum:OVERWORLD_WEATHER_FOG"
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_DEFOG_ACTIVE false
+0 screenshot fog
+0 field move 0 platinum:MOVE_DEFOG
advance text
until idle
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_DEFOG_ACTIVE true
+0 assert state weather "platinum:OVERWORLD_WEATHER_CLEAR"
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_DEFOG_ACTIVE true
+0 assert state weather "platinum:OVERWORLD_WEATHER_CLEAR"
+0 screenshot defog
